<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Product Change Notification</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { margin-top: 0; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  td { padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
  .header-logo { float: right; font-size: 48px; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">ABB</div>
  <h1>Product Change Notification</h1>
  <p>PCN-{{ pcn_number }}</p>
  <p>Dear valued Customer,</p>
  <p>ABB Cable Management Product Ltd. Will make the changes described below to products within the Adaptaflex Cable Protection product range.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Products affected by the change:</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td>Item</td>
        <td>Description</td>
        <td>Replaced by: Item</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="affected_item_code">{{ affected_item_code }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="affected_item_description">{{ affected_item_description }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="replacement_item_code">{{ replacement_item_code }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">Description of Change:</div>
  <p>In order to maintain the highest possible level of service to all our customer, we would like to inform that below items will be discontinued in Q2 '{{ current_quarter }}' with no replacement. All parts follow the life cycle stages from Active to Classic, Limited and then Obsolete. In Classic stage customer can place order beyond the inventory, however, will be subjected to a conditional MOQ. At Limited stage order will only be accepted if there is an inventory to fulfill the order. All these parts of EXHCG series are in Limited stage with 0 stock, therefore no orders will be accepted.</p>

  <div class="section-title">LCM Stages</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td>Catalogue number</td>
        <td>Q1</td>
        <td>Q2</td>
        <td>Global stock</td>
        <td>Replacement</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in lcm_stages %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="lcm_stages[{{ loop.index0 }}].catalogue_number">{{ lcm_stages[loop.index0].catalogue_number }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lcm_stages[{{ loop.index0 }}].q1">{{ lcm_stages[loop.index0].q1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lcm_stages[{{ loop.index0 }}].q2">{{ lcm_stages[loop.index0].q2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lcm_stages[{{ loop.index0 }}].global_stock">{{ lcm_stages[loop.index0].global_stock }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lcm_stages[{{ loop.index0 }}].replacement">{{ lcm_stages[loop.index0].replacement }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>For lead times and available stock of specific part numbers, please contact either the European Distribution Centre or Coleshill Customer support teams and sales offices.</p>
  <p>Coleshill UK - <span data-field="coleshill_uk_contact">{{ coleshill_uk_contact }}</span></p>
  <p>EDC Belgium - <span data-field="edc_belgium_contact">{{ edc_belgium_contact }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">ABB</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td>Catalogue number</td>
        <td>Q1</td>
        <td>Q2</td>
        <td>Global stock</td>
        <td>Replacement</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in lcm_stages %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="lcm_stages[{{ loop.index0 }}].catalogue_number">{{ lcm_stages[loop.index0].catalogue_number }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lcm_stages[{{ loop.index0 }}].q1">{{ lcm_stages[loop.index0].q1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lcm_stages[{{ loop.index0 }}].q2">{{ lcm_stages[loop.index0].q2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lcm_stages[{{ loop.index0 }}].global_stock">{{ lcm_stages[loop.index0].global_stock }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lcm_stages[{{ loop.index0 }}].replacement">{{ lcm_stages[loop.index0].replacement }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">PCN Details:</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>PCN Issued by:</td>
      <td><span data-field="pcn_issued_by">{{ pcn_issued_by }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Announcement date:</td>
      <td><span data-field="announcement_date">{{ announcement_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Change effective date:</td>
      <td><span data-field="change_effective_date">{{ change_effective_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Business Development Manager:</td>
      <td><span data-field="bdm_name">{{ bdm_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Product Line Manager:</td>
      <td><span data-field="plm_name">{{ plm_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Manufacturing Unit Manager:</td>
      <td><span data-field="mum_name">{{ mum_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div>
      <p>Please reply to:</p>
      <p>ABB Cable Management Products Limited</p>
      <p>CSG House, Station Road</p>
      <p>Birmingham</p>
      <p>B46 1JT</p>
      <p>United Kingdom</p>
      <p>Tel: <span data-field="reply_tel">{{ reply_tel }}</span></p>
      <p>Email: <span data-field="reply_email">{{ reply_email }}</span></p>
      <p>Web: <span data-field="reply_web">{{ reply_web }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Registered Office:</p>
      <p>ABB Limited</p>
      <p>Daresbury Park, Daresbury</p>
      <p>Warrington, WA4 4BT</p>
      <p>Cheshire</p>
      <p>United Kingdom</p>
      <p>Reg No: <span data-field="reg_no">{{ reg_no }}</span></p>
      <p>VAT No: <span data-field="vat_no">{{ vat_no }}</span></p>
      <p>Web: <span data-field="registered_web">{{ registered_web }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>